      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "大闘技場の地下のどっかに、何百年も前から\n捕まってる極悪人がいるんだってよ！\nそんな奴が本当にいたら見てみたいもんだ。\nお前、もしそいつに会ったら俺に教えてくれよ。",
        "official_en": "I heard a rumor that some guy's been locked up\nbeneath the arena for, like, hundreds of years! If it's\ntrue, I NEED to know what he looks like! If you ever\nmeet him, let me know, would ya?",
        "real_en": null
      },
